// The hook points an extension may attach to by name: one row per point, included with
// WXL_HOOK_POINT(name, address) defined by the expander. A name is part of the ABI: it may be
// added, never renamed or dropped. Two names may share one address; the chain is keyed by the
// address, so both detours land in the same chain. Only function entries belong here: patch sites,
// return-address anchors and data globals are not detour targets.
